Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:04.42,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,It's not too tight, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:05.38,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:06.65,Default,Evelyn,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:11.54,Default,Evelyn,0,0,0,,Master, you have a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:13.86,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Dedd Marlay, Governor-General of Holjoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:17.62,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Oh, right, that up-and-comer \Nfrom my fief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.86,0:00:20.48,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'll be right there. Let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:21.96,Default,Evelyn,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:28.33,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The royal family has a custom \Nof granting fiefs to princes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.33,0:00:31.37,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,so that they can learn \Nabout government affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.65,0:00:34.39,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,For that reason, the people of each fief
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:37.97,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,revere the prince serving as their \Nlord as if he were a monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:40.84,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,This man, who was born in Almeria
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:44.77,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,but now works in a land called Holjoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.77,0:00:46.81,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,is no exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:51.65,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(272,433)\pos(601.333,262.667)}Dedd Marlay\N{\fs13}Governor-General of Holjoy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:48.72,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,Dedd Marlay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:52.07,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,It is truly a pleasure to \Nstand in your royal presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.07,0:00:53.94,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,No need for such formalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:55.36,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:56.40,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,At once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.15,0:00:58.85,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,This is the second time we've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:00:59.95,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:03.93,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,I introduced myself to you \Nabout a year and a half ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.93,0:01:06.27,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,when the emperor appointed \Nme as governor-general.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:08.10,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,How has it been going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:11.70,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,As I recall, you were given an imperial \Norder to manage flood control in Holjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:15.92,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I can see it isn't going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:20.89,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Holjoy is a fertile grain-producing \Nregion in the bend of a large river,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.89,0:01:23.15,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,but it suffers from flooding on occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.15,0:01:25.90,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,The emperor appointed Marlay of Almeria,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:31.08,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,the home of the Water Clan, to govern \Nit in hopes that he could stabilize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:33.60,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What is the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:38.29,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,Well, we haven't received any funding, \Nand we can't use money we don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.29,0:01:40.91,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Funding? You must have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.91,0:01:42.12,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It was an imperial order.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.51,0:01:43.57,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,Yes, it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.87,0:01:47.02,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,but the Home Ministry keeps \Ncoming up with excuses...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.02,0:01:48.41,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:50.73,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.73,0:01:51.74,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:59.41,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,To what do I owe this unexpected \Nvisit, Prince Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:02:02.01,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(276,433)\an1\pos(59.333,237.333)}Maverick \N{\fs13}Minister of Finance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:06.53,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Marlay told me that you've been \Ndelaying the distribution of his funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.53,0:02:08.71,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,I most certainly have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:10.11,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Then why won't you give him the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.31,0:02:14.11,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Well, you see, there is a \Nvery good reason for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:18.65,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If you're going to say a child\Nwouldn't understand, be silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.02,0:02:25.33,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,But of course I wouldn't \Nsay something so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:26.71,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Then explain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.71,0:02:28.00,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:31.45,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Holjoy suffered flood damage \Nyet again last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:34.68,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Our kind emperor's heart \Nhurt so badly for them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:38.10,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,that he granted them a whole \Nyear of tax exemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:40.46,italics,Marlay,0,0,0,,It always comes back to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:41.45,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.45,0:02:43.73,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,That means they have leftover tax money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:47.66,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,It is the Ministry of Finance's \Nopinion that they should use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:49.91,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Do you understand now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.91,0:02:51.40,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.49,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Are you belittling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:59.23,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,They had a flood, so the emperor \Ngave them a tax exemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.23,0:03:02.61,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Why? Because they had no money to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:06.92,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It was kind of him, but that \Nitself is the core of the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:09.09,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You talk as if they have that money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:11.91,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'll ask again: are you belittling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.17,0:03:15.44,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Th-That is not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:17.01,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Explain, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:20.77,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Well... the truth is, I {\i1}can't{\i0}\Nsend them money right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:21.89,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:23.26,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,The emperor's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:24.75,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:30.04,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,You are aware of the plan to build \Nthe emperor's summer retreat, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:31.12,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:33.98,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,The emperor is not young anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:37.73,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,He should spend his summers \Nnot in the hot capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:39.98,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,but in a land that's just \Na little bit cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:43.74,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,But, although it's only a retreat, \Nit's for the emperor's use,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:45.92,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,so naturally, it will be a royal villa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:49.71,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,In short, we must build a city \Nthat he can call his villa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:52.42,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,And that requires a vast amount of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:56.06,italics,Marlay,0,0,0,,If he's bringing the emperor into this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:57.83,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Surely you understand now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:04:00.00,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,It's all we can do to give the emperor—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:00.91,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:05.61,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You're committing a grave crime \Nagainst the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.27,0:04:10.34,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,"This flooded region needs flood \Ncontrol, but we're building a villa,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.34,0:04:11.94,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,so we can't spare the money."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:14.81,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,That is what you're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:18.60,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Do you take my father for a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.90,0:04:20.70,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Y-You misunderstand!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.31,0:04:24.56,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,You misunderstand me!\NI meant nothing of the sort!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:25.99,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Then distribute the funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.99,0:04:29.31,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Or shall I go and appeal \Nto the emperor myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.31,0:04:30.71,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Certainly not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:33.20,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,I will supply Holjoy with \Nfunding right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:34.91,Default,StaffA,0,0,0,,B-But, Minister...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.91,0:04:37.17,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,And what are {\i1}you{\i0} just \Nstanding around for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.90,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Go! This gets top priority!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:39.24,top,StaffA,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:40.60,Default,Maverick,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.60,0:04:42.39,italics,Marlay,0,0,0,,What an amazing young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:45.96,italics,Marlay,0,0,0,,He got the Minister of Finance to \Nyield without lifting a finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:47.91,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,You have my utmost admiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:51.48,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,The way you negotiate is brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:54.87,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,You caught him in his gaffes and \Ncontradictions with your verbal mastery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:05:00.03,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,I am ashamed that I was foolish \Nenough to put you in this position.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:03.95,top,Marlay,0,0,0,,And then you unleashed \Nthat masterful assault...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:03.32,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I see. He thought that \Nbecause I'm a prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:05.85,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,he could use me to force \Nhis demands through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.85,0:05:09.20,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,There is naught I can do but \Nfall prostrate before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:14.09,Default,Marlay,0,0,0,,I will hurry back and proceed \Nwith the flood control measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.09,0:05:14.90,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:20.59,Default,Eunuch,0,0,0,,I bring a message!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.45,0:05:23.67,Default,Eunuch,0,0,0,,I bring a message for \Nthe Thirteenth Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:25.37,Default,Eunuch,0,0,0,,His Majesty has summoned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:27.77,Default,Eunuch,0,0,0,,He asks you to come and \Nsee him in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.77,0:05:28.97,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,The emperor?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.57,0:05:45.53,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fade(109,0)\c&H4F7C81&\bord0\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs10\pos(320,142.5)}Born Blessed, So I'll Obtain Ultimate Power
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:45.53,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fade(109,0)\p1\bord2\c&H291505&\alpha&H255&\3c&H2986A5&\fscx87\pos(311,141.167)}m 0 0 l 235 0 l 225 8 l 235 15 l 18 15 l 30 8 l 18 0
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.10,0:07:03.98,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\b1\fade(527,722)\c&H00070B&\pos(320, 205)}Episode 3
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.10,0:07:03.98,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\b1\fade(527,722)\c&H00070B&\pos(320, 225)}Those Gained, Those Lost
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:14.13,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Noah Ararat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:16.54,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I have come in response to your summons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:19.29,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Ah, you're here. You can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.88,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Thank you, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:23.44,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Allow me to start by saying, "Well done."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.38,0:07:26.30,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'm talking about Holjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:29.27,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I hear you thoroughly routed Maverick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.23,0:07:34.01,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,That only just happened! \NHow does he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.97,0:07:36.78,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Information is a weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:39.05,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,and one you should make a \Nhabit of keeping polished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.51,0:07:43.99,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes, sire... but I only did \Nwhat anyone would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:47.60,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Indeed... but what comes naturally \Ndoes not come easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:52.02,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,There are many slick tongues out \Nthere who know how to use flattery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:56.63,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Not many people can do the \Nright thing with natural ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:04.09,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Most impressive for a boy of only six.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:08.97,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:10.06,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:12.71,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,So that is what Leviathan looks like now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.71,0:08:15.87,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I see. It truly is smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.87,0:08:16.77,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:20.69,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Of course my mansion would also be \Nwithin his information network.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.69,0:08:24.10,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,The idea that you have fully \Nmastered that magic sword—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:28.55,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,considering its dark history—can \Nonly be described as remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:36.63,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,If I hadn't stopped it back then, it \Nwould have killed everyone in that market.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:38.90,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,A dark history, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:42.92,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It would serve you well to learn \Nthe techniques to wield it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:45.43,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I've summoned an instructor \Nof swordsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.49,0:08:50.84,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,Damion Noble, at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.87,0:08:50.82,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(272,541)\pos(601.333,245)}Damion Noble\N{\fs13}Kingdom's Greatest Swordsman
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:53.60,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Noble is the empire's greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:56.73,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It is said that there are \Nnone who can match him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.73,0:08:58.13,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,You honor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:09:00.15,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Learn from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:00.88,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:02.37,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:06.69,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,If I may, I would like to \Nrequest a bout right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:09.08,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,With a child who still knows nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:12.97,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,Not to worry. I will observe only \Nhis aptitude, not his technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:14.28,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:18.66,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,He convinced my father. \NHe clearly has his trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:20.16,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,If I may.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.93,0:09:24.15,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,Now, come at me however you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:41.08,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Leviathan's memories \Nare flowing into me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:44.22,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,The memories of all its past owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.87,0:09:50.24,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:59.60,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Truly a magic sword that \Nchooses its own master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:03.43,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Its previous owners must have \Nbeen very skilled, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.93,0:10:06.86,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.30,0:10:09.25,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,I sincerely apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:13.06,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,I have nothing to teach the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:17.28,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,His strength and speed are \Nindeed those of a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:20.72,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,but he used technique alone to disarm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:24.89,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,His Highness already possesses the \Nswordsmanship skill of a master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:27.61,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,It would be presumptuous \Nof me to try to teach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:29.69,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,I am soundly defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.11,0:10:33.03,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I see. So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.60,0:10:40.47,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Impressive! You truly \Nare something, Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.47,0:10:41.32,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:45.87,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I will make you head judge in this \Nyear's knight selection exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:50.02,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,There is no one better \Nsuited for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.02,0:10:51.48,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What say you, Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.10,0:10:54.96,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Understood. I will see this task through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.17,0:10:58.75,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The knight selection exam
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:11:04.52,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,is an annual event involving participants \Nfrom all corners of the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:09.95,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,For this empire, a nation of warriors \Nthat treasures its military,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:15.93,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,it is said that the way of the warrior \Nis the only path to success by merit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:20.23,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the exam, the fighters who win \Ntheir regional preliminaries
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.23,0:11:22.14,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,meet in the capital for \Ntheir final battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.42,0:11:25.93,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The one who emerges victorious\Nearns the title of knight
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.93,0:11:29.26,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and immediately joins the \Nupper ranks of society.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:34.72,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,The first job of the new knight is to \Nbecome a subordinate of the head judge.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.84,0:11:40.21,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(14,20)}Thirteenth Imperial Prince Noah Ararat \NSex: Male \NLevel: 1\h/\h∞ \NHP: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFire: F\NMP: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWater: E+SS\NStrength: F+F\h\h\h\h\hWind: F\NStamina: F+F\h\h\h\h\h\hEarth: F\NIntelligence: F\h\h\h\h\hLight: F\NSpirit: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hDark: F \NSpeed: F
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:40.21,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H5D554C&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 225 0 225 66 0 66
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:40.21,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,With a talented knight in my service, \NI could become even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.61,0:11:43.18,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Then let me ask you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:45.61,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,How shall Noah judge this event?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.61,0:11:48.35,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,By either round-robin or elimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.86,0:11:51.95,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,That is the first thing the \Nhead judge must decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.03,0:11:54.35,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I have one request.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:56.60,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I want to do away with the \Nregional preliminaries
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.60,0:11:58.94,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,and do all the judging \Nhere in the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.94,0:12:01.32,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,before my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.48,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:04.40,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,The empire is vast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:07.83,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I can't observe all the \Npreliminaries in every region.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.36,0:12:12.20,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want any strong candidates \Nto be excluded for arbitrary reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:15.08,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I don't want to overlook any talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:19.08,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.08,0:12:19.95,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.28,0:12:23.62,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:25.27,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.27,0:12:26.26,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:29.96,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Are there any knight selection exam \Nparticipants in your village?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.30,0:12:33.24,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Yes, one who is our simple \Nvillage's lone gateway to glory,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:36.99,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,and the only one our village \Nsends to the exam every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:38.47,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.47,0:12:41.37,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I did away with the regional \Npreliminaries this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:42.94,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,so they can send more if they like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:44.96,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,If it pleases you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:45.83,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.07,0:12:49.22,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing. I do apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.22,0:12:51.64,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'm not angry or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:54.56,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I just want to know what you \Nwere thinking. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:58.07,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,It's nothing of consequence, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:13:00.88,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,The reason our village sends \Nonly one challenger is because
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:03.36,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,we can't afford the travel \Nand lodging expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:05.60,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Everything costs more in the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:08.68,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,so it takes donations from \Nall of us just to send one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:13.04,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,That one ends up shouldering \Nall of the village's hopes,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:14.62,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,so they all get very serious about—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:16.60,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,All right. I'll do away with that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:20.17,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I want to choose from among \Nas many as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:22.90,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It wouldn't do to overlook any \Ntalent for such a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:25.48,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I will cover all travel \Nand lodging expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:28.96,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,That... would make everyone \Nin our village very happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:30.73,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,but wouldn't it cost a \Ngreat deal of money?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:34.07,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It doesn't mean arranging \Neverything from nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.99,0:13:35.87,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:38.02,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.39,0:13:42.43,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Find out how many vacant houses are \Nin the capital, and buy them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.43,0:13:44.31,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If that's enough, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.31,0:13:46.72,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If not, we'll build a dormitory of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:48.48,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:50.14,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,And then there's the matter of meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:52.91,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Talk to all the merchants \Nwe have connections with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:54.27,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'll go out to town, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.27,0:13:56.39,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Master, you are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:59.36,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,This is my estimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.06,0:14:01.63,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,This can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:03.85,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,We're talking about food for \Nthe duration of the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.85,0:14:05.28,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,This leaves you with a deep deficit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:09.54,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Yes, but this is a request from \Nthe Thirteenth Prince himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.09,0:14:12.08,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:16.03,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Merchants don't give money \Naway out of mere compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.61,0:14:18.42,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What is it you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.90,0:14:24.63,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,To think a boy your age, and a noble at \Nthat, understands the world so well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:29.35,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It's more like using money \Nwastefully is part of my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:30.88,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,You never cease to amaze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.19,0:14:32.89,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Well? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.28,0:14:35.59,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,There is a palace employment exam
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:38.90,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,run on roughly the same scale \Nas the knight selection exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:44.18,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,And, well... I was hoping you would \Nknow what sorts of people are hired.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.18,0:14:47.32,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,So you want to put a girl in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:48.48,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:51.86,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,If he had the support of \Nsomeone in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.86,0:14:54.31,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,he'd be the first to hear \Nany new information.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.31,0:14:59.24,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,And if she were to be ordered to spend \Nnights with the emperor as a consort,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:01.24,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,the profits would be immeasurable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:04.93,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Of course, this has nothing to \Ndo with what you've asked of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:08.42,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,I have already sent a token of \Nmy gratitude to your mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.73,0:15:11.12,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Advance payment, eh? Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:12.65,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,One condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.65,0:15:13.44,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.86,0:15:17.20,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If it's a girl I like, \NI'll put in a good word.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:19.88,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:22.47,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,But it must be a girl\NI sincerely approve of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.77,0:15:26.35,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Of course. I will choose one who \Nmeasures up to your standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:30.04,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Your Highness...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.68,0:15:34.94,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Your kindness and keen perception,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:38.62,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,for a man like me, elevate \Nyou above all others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:41.58,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Please allow me to\Nadd the crest of the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:44.71,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Thirteenth Prince's house\Nto my store sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.95,0:15:47.31,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You will fully devote \Nyourself to my service?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.31,0:15:48.05,Default,Byron/Cyndi,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:52.21,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Know that I will not tolerate betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.43,0:16:01.44,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Accepting Byron as a subordinate \Nincreased my stats.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.43,0:16:05.52,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(14,20)}HP: F\h\h\h\h\hFire: F\NMP: F\h\h\h\hWater: E+SS\NStrength: F+F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWind: F\NStamina: F+F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hEarth: F\NIntelligence: F+F\h\h\h\hLight: F \NSpirit: F+F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hDark: F \NSpeed: F \NDexterity: F+F \NLuck F+F
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:05.52,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H150A07&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 158 0 158 59 0 59
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:04.70,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,If I keep this up, I \Ncan get even stronger.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.11,0:16:08.94,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(14,20)}HP: F\h\h\h\h\hFire: F\NMP: F\h\h\h\hWater: E+SS\NStrength: F+F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWind: F\NStamina: F+F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hEarth: F\NIntelligence: F+F\h\h\h\hLight: F
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.11,0:16:08.94,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H3F2D20&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 158 0 158 34 0 34
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.03,0:16:13.78,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(14,20)}Fire: F \NWater: E+S \NWind: F \NEarth: F
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.03,0:16:13.78,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H3B3024&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 71 0 71 27 0 27
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:12.43,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,One of my stats went down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.43,0:16:13.78,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,The SS on Water...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.23,0:16:16.36,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Has something happened in Almeria?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:19.06,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Zoey, I'm going to see the emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:20.33,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Head for the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:23.18,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Tell the driver! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.18,0:16:24.34,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:34.76,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Hmm... A change in Almeria?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.76,0:16:35.60,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.60,0:16:37.14,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.14,0:16:39.26,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,The way he said that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:41.76,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You know of it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:42.86,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:45.53,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I merely noticed the signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:49.51,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Then... what the signs indicated\Nhas indeed come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:51.80,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.59,0:17:03.62,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Impressive, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:04.78,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.78,0:17:05.84,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.19,0:17:08.64,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,There has been a rebellion in Almeria.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:12.96,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,How large do you believe it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:18.39,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Considering my SS just dropped to S,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.39,0:17:20.53,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,it might look like it dropped by half,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:22.49,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,but the reality is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:26.21,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,it only went down by one \Nrank out of several.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:26.98,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFEFCFD&\3c&HA68A8A&\4c&H44363A&\bord1\blur2\shad4\b1\move(209.333,71.333,209.333,-3,0,4170)}Fire\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\3c&HB69B89&}Water\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NWind\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NEarth\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NLight
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:28.10,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.52,0:17:31.25,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I believe it is small \Nin scale at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:32.48,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:35.41,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,The report identified\Nfive thousand rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.41,0:17:37.87,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,So I was right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.23,0:17:42.07,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Their numbers are low, \Nand it's in your fief.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.07,0:17:45.79,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Noah, have you any intention \Nof putting it down yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:48.50,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I fear that is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.42,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.74,0:17:53.25,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I am still young and \Nunfamiliar with combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.25,0:17:55.95,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I don't know whether the \Nsoldiers would listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.95,0:17:58.23,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If we're to send a prince \Nto subjugate it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.23,0:18:00.97,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I think it should be one \Nof my older brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.97,0:18:03.05,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,That is not the answer I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.05,0:18:06.94,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You looked at the situation so \Nobjectively before refusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:12.64,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Very well. I will stand by your \Njudgment and choose another.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.01,0:18:14.69,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Is there one you would recommend?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.21,0:18:17.97,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Of the princes, I believe \NHenry is the best choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.97,0:18:19.24,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.62,0:18:23.12,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,With such low numbers, the orthodox \Napproach is to suppress them head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:26.38,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,As the most prudent of my brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.27,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I believe Henry is up to the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:31.66,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,A fine choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.06,0:18:33.50,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Bring Henry to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.93,0:18:47.60,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Are you sure? This could \Nhave been your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:49.92,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,The empire is a nation of warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:53.57,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,A great achievement in battle \Nnow could benefit you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:56.38,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I am not well-learned enough \Nfor such a sudden deployment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:19:00.96,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Even if I survived, many soldiers \Nwould likely die in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:02.73,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Calm and collected as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:05.33,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:06.79,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Stop the carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:10.29,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.65,0:19:12.66,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Leviathan reacted to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.66,0:19:15.75,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,It's me they're after.\NI can't get my brother involved!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:30.52,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:31.49,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:42.01,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Water users...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.01,0:19:43.86,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,They're Almerian rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:47.88,Default,Man in BlackA,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:06.20,Default,Man in BlackA,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:08.27,Default,Man in BlackA,0,0,0,,A child... like him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.93,0:20:13.80,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:15.27,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:16.19,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:17.88,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:20.70,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,You've gotten even stronger in the \Nfew days since I last saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.31,0:20:24.45,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,I'd heard that the rebel army \Nwas centered around cavalrymen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:26.49,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,but I guess they had some like this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:30.73,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,If only we could have \Ninterrogated them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.73,0:20:32.24,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I didn't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.02,0:20:35.42,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,After cutting them down,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:38.32,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I used Leviathan's threat \Nto knock them unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.94,0:20:41.91,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,People like these are too \Nlikely to kill themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.79,0:20:44.23,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.23,0:20:45.94,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,They're all breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.49,0:20:49.77,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'll let you handle them. \NMore importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.13,0:20:53.80,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Did you mention cavalrymen earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.22,0:20:57.79,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Almeria does not have a strong \Nsupply of war horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.79,0:20:58.47,Default,Henry,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:05.23,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,You wanted to see me, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.23,0:21:06.38,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:10.34,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You do business in the area \Nsurrounding Almeria as well, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.34,0:21:11.11,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.49,0:21:14.16,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Consider yourself dead \Nif you tell anyone this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.12,0:21:16.92,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,There's been a rebellion in Almeria.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.23,0:21:21.04,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I've been told that cavalrymen \Nare the center of their forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:24.00,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,There's 10,000 rean here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:27.06,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Purchase all the horse feed \Nin the fief immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:27.97,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,At once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:31.49,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Should I secure the \Nstandard rations, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.49,0:21:33.24,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,If you'll entrust me with—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:34.57,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,We don't need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.93,0:21:39.14,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,War horses are not raised in Almeria.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.51,0:21:45.00,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,According to my brother, Henry, the \Nrebels' horses were purchased elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:49.08,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,There's only so much horse feed \Nthey could steal from citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.65,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,If we took the soldiers' rations, \Nthey'd start looting...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.17,0:21:57.80,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Absolutely brilliant!\NI'll get started at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:08.25,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,This should make it a bit easier \Nfor my brother to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.49,0:22:12.97,sign_generic,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an3\fade(443,0)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&HC3D0DD&\3c&H374B69&\blur1\bord1.5\fs10\pos(302.667,258.667)}Translation:\NTiming:\NEditing:\NQuality Control:
